    "title": "Lady Toppers finish sixth at Coastal Georgia Fall Invitational - NewsBreak",
    "text": "bmcusports.com\nwebsite\nSaint Simons Island\nLady Toppers finish sixth at Coastal Georgia Fall Invitational\n1 days ago\nSt. Simons Island, Ga.- The BMCU women's golf team officially opened its season this week with a sixth place finish out of nine teams at the Coastal Georgia Fall Invitational. Morgan Dabbs led the Toppers with a strong showing, finishing 17th overall after shooting rounds of 79 and 83 for a total of 162. Close behind was Petrone Rudolph, who placed 19th with scores of 84 and 81 (165).",
